title: "Circulatory Fidelity: A Relational Theory of Information Flow in Hierarchical Models"
version: 1.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.18121821
date-released: 2026-01-04
url: "https://github.com/Bwana7/Circulatory_Fidelity"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Bwana7/Circulatory_Fidelity"
